---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Neurinlab"
  description="Neurinlab explores how to use fast tools while still thinking for ourselves and writing in our own words."
  lang="en"
  current="about"
>
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Neurinlab’s Starting Question</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Keeping Our Thinking and Language<br />in the Age of AI</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy compact">
        Neurinlab explores how to use fast tools while still thinking for ourselves,<br />
        writing in our own words, and expressing ideas with more depth.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="section-inner split-grid">
      <h2 class="section-title">Where Neurinlab Begins</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        AI makes output faster. But when answers arrive before we have held onto the question,
        and sentences appear before we have shaped our own expression,
        our thinking can begin to blur. Neurinlab begins there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="info-card">
          <h2>AI and Thinking</h2>
          <p>Answers arrive faster, but the question can become less clear. We begin by holding onto what we actually want to ask.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h2>Writing and Expression</h2>
          <p>It is easier to produce sentences now, but they may not feel like our own. We reread fast drafts and shape them into language that fits.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h2>Ideas and Tools</h2>
          <p>Ideas can pile up while the flow remains unclear. We gather scattered thoughts into structure and connect them to the next action.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
